:20: [LOOP-001] Aether loop error: `loop c in s` walks `s`
hint: to walk it as the body changes it (a worklist, or updating elements), index it: `let i: Int = 0; loop i < len(xs) { let x: Int = xs[i]; ... i = i + 1; }`
copy them first: `let snapshot: Int[] = xs; loop x in snapshot { ... }`
